[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0010","text":"我拍了會場周邊的照片回來"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0020","text":"哇──！／哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0030","text":"戴著CoMETIK周邊的人，好多呢──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0040","text":"是啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0050","text":"他們是為了CoMETIK才來今天的活動的嗎？\n好開心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0060","text":"還有，社群媒體上也有很多\n對新曲首次公開的期待留言"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0070","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0080","text":"新曲啊……\n跟錄歌唱節目不一樣，今天可不能出錯呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0090","text":"嗯、嗯……\n一想到這個，就開始緊張了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0100","text":"是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0110","text":"……要不要再確認一次舞步呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0120","text":"製作人先生，\n時間還來得及吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0130","text":"行啊，没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0140","text":"那我也一起練吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0150","text":"嘻嘻～，嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0160","text":"路加你呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0180","text":"──從頭到尾，一遍"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0190","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_08_0200","text":"呵呵……\n那就從曲子開頭開始播囉……！"}]
